{"The folder with your own game folders (exefs/romfs) of The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild for Nintendo Switch, version 1.0.0. The game isn't included with BOTWRecompAndroid.",
 "包含你自己的 Nintendo Switch 版《塞尔达传说 旷野之息》1.0.0 版本游戏文件夹（exefs/romfs）的文件夹。BOTWRecompAndroid 不包含游戏本身。"},
{"The folder with your own game folders (exefs/romfs, or exefs and a romfs.bin) of The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild for Nintendo Switch: version 1.0.0, 1.6.0, 1.8.2 or 1.9.0 (the last two in Brazilian Portuguese). The version is told from the files, and each one is set up in a place of its own, beside the others. The game isn't included with BOTWRecompAndroid.",
 "包含你自己的 Nintendo Switch 版《塞尔达传说 旷野之息》游戏文件夹（exefs/romfs，或 exefs 与 romfs.bin）的文件夹：版本 1.0.0、1.6.0、1.8.2 或 1.9.0（最后两个含巴西葡萄牙语）。版本会根据文件识别，每个版本都会在各自的位置并排设置。BOTWRecompAndroid 不包含游戏本身。"},
{"Game data incomplete: copy romfs.bin again whole",
 "游戏数据不完整：请重新完整复制 romfs.bin"},
{"The romfs.bin in that folder can't be read whole. Copy it again from where it was made, or make it again.",
 "该文件夹中的 romfs.bin 无法完整读取。请从生成它的地方重新复制，或重新生成。"},
{"Taking the movies out of the game data...",
 "正在从游戏数据中取出视频..."},
{"The game code didn't build",
 "游戏代码未能编译"},
{"The game code needs building",
 "需要编译游戏代码"},
{"The game data (romfs) and the game code (exefs) are from different versions. Choose a folder where both come from the same version.",
 "游戏数据（romfs）和游戏代码（exefs）来自不同版本。请选择两者来自同一版本的文件夹。"},
{"The game files are already here: this builds the game code from them again, as BOTWRecompAndroid needs after an update. It may take a while.",
 "游戏文件已在这里：这会用它们重新编译游戏代码，这是 BOTWRecompAndroid 更新后需要的。可能需要一些时间。"},
{"The game runs on the system's driver, lighting included. On Adreno GPUs, Mesa's Turnip driver runs it faster: choose a Turnip driver package (.zip, as for adrenotools).",
 "游戏使用系统驱动运行，包括光照。在 Adreno GPU 上，Mesa 的 Turnip 驱动运行得更快：请选择一个 Turnip 驱动包（.zip，和 adrenotools 用的一样）。"},
{"The game's first release, without updates.",
 "游戏的首个版本，不含更新。"},
{"An update of the game, in Brazilian Portuguese too. 60 fps and widescreen (Video settings) work in this one.",
 "游戏的一次更新，同样含巴西葡萄牙语。60 fps 和宽屏（视频设置）在此版本中可用。"},
{"The game's last update (2025), in Brazilian Portuguese too. Being brought up: expect problems.",
 "游戏的最后一次更新（2025 年），同样含巴西葡萄牙语。仍在适配中：可能会有问题。"},
{"The phone's gyroscope - or a controller's that has one - aims the bow and the Sheikah Slate's camera and tilts the shrines' motion puzzles, as the Switch's motion controls do. The game's own options can turn motion aiming off.",
 "手机的陀螺仪（或带陀螺仪的手柄）可以瞄准弓和希卡石板的相机，并倾斜神庙中的体感谜题，就像 Switch 的体感操作。游戏自身的选项可以关闭体感瞄准。"},
{"The game's reverb effect (echo in caves and big rooms).",
 "游戏的混响效果（洞穴和大房间里的回声）。"},
{"The game's text language, as its own system setting, and the app's menus' too (Auto: the phone's). The game's text changes when the game restarts (Quit -> Title screen, then Play); the menus when the app starts again.",
 "游戏文本的语言（游戏自身的系统设置），也是应用菜单的语言（自动：手机的语言）。游戏文本在游戏重新开始时更改（退出 -> 标题画面，然后开始游戏）；菜单在应用重新打开时更改。"},
{"The game's volume. 100% is the game's own level; above it, louder.",
 "游戏音量。100% 是游戏原本的音量；高于它会更响。"},
{"the system's driver",
 "系统驱动"},
{"The system's driver from the next start on. Restart BOTWRecompAndroid to use it.",
 "从下次启动起使用系统驱动。重新启动 BOTWRecompAndroid 即可使用。"},
{"These options are for Turnip: the driver in use takes the safer paths anyway.",
 "这些选项是给 Turnip 用的：当前使用的驱动本来就走更稳妥的方式。"},
{"They aren't in BOTWRecompAndroid's data folder, so they were left alone.",
 "它们不在 BOTWRecompAndroid 的数据文件夹中，所以没有动它们。"},
{"This deletes BOTWRecompAndroid's copy of the game files (%.1f GB).",
 "这会删除 BOTWRecompAndroid 复制的游戏文件（%.1f GB）。"},
{"This GPU: %s",
 "此 GPU：%s"},
{"This only needs to be done once and may take a while.",
 "只需进行一次，可能需要一些时间。"},
{"Those files can't be used",
 "这些文件无法使用"},
{"Touch controls",
 "触屏操作"},
{"Translates the game's shaders with 32-bit address math, the path used for drivers without 64-bit integers (Adreno 6xx / 7xx and Mali stock drivers). Try it if lighting, grass or text are missing or wrong on your GPU. Applies to shaders translated from now on: restart the app for all of them.",
 "用 32 位地址运算转换游戏的着色器，这是没有 64 位整数的驱动所用的方式（Adreno 6xx / 7xx 和 Mali 原装驱动）。如果你的 GPU 上光照、草地或文字缺失或出错，可以试试。只对此后转换的着色器生效：重启应用即可全部生效。"},
{"Turn on Touch controls (Video tab) to edit the layout.",
 "请先开启触屏操作（视频标签页）再编辑布局。"},
{"Turnip low-resolution Z (LRZ)",
 "Turnip 低分辨率 Z（LRZ）"},
{"Turnip's early depth test, a little faster. Off can fix missing or broken drawing on some Adreno GPUs. Automatic: on for Adreno 8xx GPUs, off for the others. Applies when BOTWRecompAndroid restarts.",
 "Turnip 的提前深度测试，稍快一些。关闭可修复某些 Adreno GPU 上缺失或破损的画面。自动：Adreno 8xx GPU 上开启，其他关闭。在 BOTWRecompAndroid 重新启动后生效。"},
{"Unlocked",
 "自由"},
{"Unlocked (fill the screen)",
 "自由（填满屏幕）"},
{"Unlocked: the view fills the screen, so wider screens show more of Hyrule, and the HUD moves out to its edges (menus stay in the middle). Game versions 1.8.2 and 1.9.0 (1.0.0 and 1.6.0 keep 16:9 with bars); a change applies when the game starts again (Quit -> Return to start, then Play). Original 16:9: the game's own framing, with bars.",
 "自由：画面填满屏幕，屏幕越宽能看到的海拉鲁越多，HUD 也会移到屏幕边缘（菜单保持在中间）。适用于游戏版本 1.8.2 和 1.9.0（1.0.0 和 1.6.0 保持带黑边的 16:9）；更改会在游戏重新开始时生效（退出 -> 回到开始界面，然后开始游戏）。原始 16:9：游戏本来的取景，带黑边。"},
{"Upscaler",
 "放大器"},
{"Use substitute font",
 "使用替代字体"},
{"Use the system driver",
 "使用系统驱动"},
{"Version",
 "版本"},
{"Versions 1.0.0, 1.6.0, 1.8.2 and 1.9.0 can be set up side by side, each with its own saves.",
 "1.0.0、1.6.0、1.8.2 和 1.9.0 版本可以并排设置，各自有自己的存档。"},
{"Versions and setup",
 "版本与设置"},
{"Video",
 "视频"},
{"Volume",
 "音量"},
{"Vulkan driver",
 "Vulkan 驱动"},
{"Which version PLAY starts. Each one keeps its own game files, saves and settings; 1.6.0, 1.8.2 and 1.9.0 start from a copy of 1.0.0's saves and settings. Choosing another one starts BOTWRecompAndroid again with it.",
 "“开始游戏”启动的版本。每个版本都有自己的游戏文件、存档和设置；1.6.0、1.8.2 和 1.9.0 从 1.0.0 的存档和设置的副本开始。选择其他版本会以该版本重新启动 BOTWRecompAndroid。"},
{"Working...",
 "处理中..."},
{"Writes what the app reports (GPU, driver, errors) to botwrecomp-log.txt in a folder you choose (create one, e.g. Download/BOTWRecomp), to open on the phone and send with a bug report. Turn it on and play until the problem shows; after a crash, the run before is kept as botwrecomp-log-previous.txt.",
 "把应用报告的内容（GPU、驱动、错误）写入你选择的文件夹中的 botwrecomp-log.txt（新建一个，例如 Download/BOTWRecomp），方便在手机上打开并随错误报告一起发送。开启后一直玩到问题出现；崩溃之后，上一次运行会保存为 botwrecomp-log-previous.txt。"},
{"Wrong game version (needs v1.0.0, v1.6.0, v1.8.2 or v1.9.0)",
 "游戏版本不对（需要 v1.0.0、v1.6.0、v1.8.2 或 v1.9.0）"},
{"Wrong version of the game",
 "游戏版本不对"},
{"Xbox button",
 "Xbox 按钮"},
{"Yes, delete them",
 "是，删除"},
{"You can change this any time in Settings.",
 "你可以随时在设置中更改。"},
{"You're on the start screen.",
 "你在开始界面。"},
{"Your copy of the game",
 "你的游戏副本"},
{"Camera by dragging",
 "拖动控制镜头"},
{"The camera turns while a finger moves on the right half of the screen and stops when it stops, as in phone shooters, instead of a stick held to one side.",
 "手指在屏幕右半边移动时镜头跟着转动，手指停下镜头也停下，就像手机射击游戏一样，不必把摇杆一直推向一边。"},
{"Drag sensitivity",
 "拖动灵敏度"},
{"Sticks only while touched",
 "仅在触摸时显示摇杆"},
{"The sticks are drawn only while a finger holds them, for a cleaner screen.",
 "只有手指按住时才绘制摇杆，让画面更干净。"},
{"Larger stick areas",
 "扩大摇杆区域"},
{"Each stick starts anywhere on its half of the screen, not only in the lower part. The buttons stay in front.",
 "每个摇杆可以从屏幕对应的半边任意位置开始，而不只是下方。按钮仍在最前面。"},
{"Auto",
 "自动"},
{"Auto: 1080p on screens with more lines than that, where it costs the GPU the most; the screen's own on the others.",
 "自动：在行数多于 1080 的屏幕上使用 1080p（这时 GPU 负担最重），其他屏幕使用屏幕本身的分辨率。"},
{"Saves",
 "存档"},
{"Export saves",
 "导出存档"},
{"Import saves",
 "导入存档"},
{"Saves imported.",
 "存档已导入。"},
{"Saves imported. The ones before are kept beside them as %s.",
 "存档已导入。原来的存档以 %s 保留在旁边。"},
{"That didn't work: %s",
 "操作失败：%s"},
{"Stick dead zone",
 "摇杆死区"},
{"A stick held this close to the centre counts as centred, for worn sticks that move Link or the camera on their own (drift). Off: only the game's own.",
 "离中心这么近的摇杆输入视为居中，用于会让林克或镜头自己移动的老化摇杆（漂移）。关闭：只用游戏自身的。"},
{"The saves are in the app's own folder, out of file managers' reach. Export saves this version's as one .zip where you choose (to keep, edit, send or move them). Import replaces them with the saves in a .zip - one exported here, or any holding 0, 1, 2... and option.sav; Import from folder takes an emulator's save folder. The ones before are kept beside them. A save from a newer version of the game may not load in an older one.",
 "存档在应用自己的文件夹里，文件管理器无法访问。导出会把此版本的存档保存为一个 .zip，放到你选择的位置（用于保留、编辑、发送或转移）。导入会用 .zip 中的存档替换现有存档：可以是从这里导出的，也可以是任何包含 0、1、2... 和 option.sav 的 .zip；“从文件夹导入”使用模拟器的存档文件夹。原来的存档会保留在旁边。较新游戏版本的存档可能无法在较旧版本中读取。"},
{"Saves exported to %s.",
 "存档已导出到 %s。"},
{"No BOTW save there: look for the one that holds 0, 1, 2... and option.sav.",
 "那里没有 BOTW 存档：请找包含 0、1、2... 和 option.sav 的那个。"},
{"Import from folder",
 "从文件夹导入"},
{"DLC",
 "DLC"},
{"The Expansion Pass - The Master Trials and The Champions' Ballad - for game versions 1.6.0, 1.8.2 and 1.9.0. Choose the folder with your own DLC's extracted romfs: the larger pack (01007EF00011F001, 7,094 files, about 1.4 GB) holds both; the other one is only the Ballad's unlock and isn't needed. The DLC isn't included with BOTWRecompAndroid.",
 "扩充票（剑之试炼与英杰之诗），适用于游戏版本 1.6.0、1.8.2 和 1.9.0。请选择你自己的 DLC 中提取出的 romfs 文件夹：较大的包（01007EF00011F001，7,094 个文件，约 1.4 GB）包含两者；另一个只是英杰之诗的解锁，不需要。BOTWRecompAndroid 不包含 DLC。"},
{"Installed.",
 "已安装。"},
{"Not installed.",
 "未安装。"},
{"Installing the DLC... %d%%",
 "正在安装 DLC... %d%%"},
{"Install again",
 "重新安装"},
{"Install DLC",
 "安装 DLC"},
{"Remove DLC",
 "移除 DLC"},
{"DLC removed.",
 "DLC 已移除。"},
{"DLC installed. Start the game: the title shows Master Mode.",
 "DLC 已安装。启动游戏后，标题画面会出现大师模式。"},
{"No DLC there: choose the folder with the DLC's romfs (System/AocVersion.txt and Pack).",
 "那里没有 DLC：请选择包含 DLC 的 romfs（System/AocVersion.txt 和 Pack）的文件夹。"},
{"That's only the Champions' Ballad's unlock: choose the larger pack (01007EF00011F001), which holds both DLCs.",
 "那只是英杰之诗的解锁：请选择包含两个 DLC 的较大的包（01007EF00011F001）。"},
{"The game starts its next frame while the GPU still finishes the last one: a few more fps. What the game reads back from the GPU then comes a frame late, and Link's legs can sink into the ground while he stands still. Turn it off if that bothers you. Applies at once.",
 "GPU 还在完成上一帧时，游戏就开始下一帧：fps 会高一些。代价是游戏从 GPU 读回的结果会晚一帧，林克站着不动时腿可能陷进地面。介意的话请关闭。立即生效。"},
{"Game code",
 "游戏代码"},
{"Recompiled",
 "重新编译"},
{"Native (experimental)",
 "原生 (实验性)"},
{"Copy them",
 "复制"},
{"Use them in place",
 "就地使用"},
{"Copy them: the setup copies the game data (about 16 GB) into BOTWRecompAndroid's folder - your folder can be moved or deleted afterwards.\n\nUse them in place: the game reads its data from your folder, no copy - it saves the space and the wait. It needs the permission to access all files (Android asks), and the folder must stay where it is: moved or deleted, the game files have to be set up again.",
 "复制：设置时会把游戏数据（约 16 GB）复制到 BOTWRecompAndroid 的文件夹 - 之后你的文件夹可以移动或删除。\n\n就地使用：游戏直接从你的文件夹读取数据，不复制 - 省下空间和等待时间。需要访问所有文件的权限（Android 会询问），而且文件夹必须留在原处：移动或删除后，游戏文件需要重新设置。"},
{"Recompiled: the setup rebuilds the game's code for this phone from your files (once, it may take a while). Set up this way, the game can still run natively: Video > Native game code.\n\nNative: the game's own code runs directly on the phone's CPU, so the setup only copies the files - no build. An experiment. Switching to Recompiled later means building the game code then.",
 "重新编译：设置时会根据你的文件为这部手机重新构建游戏代码（只需一次，可能需要一些时间）。这样设置后，游戏仍然可以以原生方式运行：视频 > 原生游戏代码。\n\n原生：游戏自身的代码直接在手机的 CPU 上运行，因此设置只会复制文件 - 无需构建。这是一项实验。之后切换到重新编译时，会在那时构建游戏代码。"},
{"Copies the game files BOTWRecompAndroid needs (native game code: nothing to build). Your own files aren't changed.",
 "复制 BOTWRecompAndroid 需要的游戏文件（原生游戏代码：无需构建）。你自己的文件不会被修改。"},
{"Native game code (experimental)",
 "原生游戏代码 (实验性)"},
{"Runs the game's own code directly on the phone's CPU instead of the game code built at setup: no build needed. An experiment - report what goes wrong. Applies the next time the game starts.",
 "直接在手机的 CPU 上运行游戏自身的代码，而不是设置时构建的游戏代码：无需构建。这是一项实验 - 请报告出现的问题。下次启动游戏时生效。"},
{"Cutscenes at 60 fps (experimental)",
 "过场动画 60 fps (实验性)"},
{"In-game cutscenes and talks run at the chosen frame rate instead of 30. Some of them count frames and may run shorter or out of step with their sound (at 60 fps the new game's opening gave Link control 2 s early). Videos and menus stay at 30. Applies at once.",
 "游戏内的过场动画和对话以所选帧率运行，而不是 30。有些会计算帧数，可能变短或与声音不同步（在 60 fps 下，新游戏的开场让林克提前 2 秒获得控制）。视频和菜单保持 30。立即生效。"},
